{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "crovn-api-collection",
		"name": "CROVN API - Tienda de Ropa",
		"description": "## 🛍️ CROVN API\n\nAPI completa para tienda de ropa colombiana (Crovn) con panel de administración.\n\n### 📋 Características\n- **Landing pública**: catálogo, carrito, checkout, consulta de pedidos\n- **Admin**: login, inventario (productos + variantes), clientes, pedidos, promociones, publicaciones, proveedores\n- **Pagos**: descuentos por código promocional y ofertas\n- **Email**: confirmaciones de pedido y cambios de estado (nodemailer)\n- **WhatsApp**: enlace directo wa.me\n\n### 🔑 Autenticación\nLos endpoints de admin requieren header `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Obtén el token en `POST /api/auth/login`.\n\n### 📦 Base URL\n`http://localhost:4000`\n\n### 👤 Credenciales de prueba\n- **Superadmin**: `oscar` / `12345`\n- **Admin**: `johana` / `12345`\n\n### 💰 Moneda\nPesos colombianos (COP), locale `es-CO`\n\n### 📝 Notas\n- Las imágenes se envían como `multipart/form-data` (campos `image`, `images[]`) y se almacenan como Base64 en MySQL\n- Los productos tienen variantes (tallas × colores), cada una con stock y SKU propios\n- Los proveedores tienen costos/porcentajes individuales por producto",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🔐 Auth",
			"description": "Autenticación de administradores. Login, sesión actual y cambio de contraseña.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login (obtener token)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"// Guarda el token automáticamente en la variable 'token'",
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json?.data?.token) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
									"    console.log('Token guardado en variable: token');",
									"} else {",
									"    console.log('No se encontró token en la respuesta');",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"oscar\",\n  \"password\": \"12345\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
						},
						"description": "Inicia sesión y retorna un token HMAC (válido 12h). Úsalo en `Authorization: Bearer <token>` para endpoints protegidos.\n\n**Credenciales:**\n- oscar / 12345 (superadmin)\n- johana / 12345 (admin)\n\n**Automático:** El test guarda el token en la variable `token` de la colección."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Mi sesión (requiere auth)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
						},
						"description": "Retorna el admin actualmente autenticado (id, username, name, role)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Cambiar contraseña (requiere auth)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"12345\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"nueva123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "change-password"]
						},
						"description": "Cambia la contraseña del admin autenticado."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "🛍️ Shop (público)",
			"description": "Endpoints públicos para la landing: catálogo, checkout, consulta de pedidos. **No requieren autenticación.**",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Catálogo completo (landing)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/shop",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "shop"]
						},
						"description": "Retorna todo lo que necesita la landing: productos activos, publicaciones activas, configuración."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Productos (con filtros)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/shop/products?category=Camisetas&size=M&q=qatar&lowStock=false",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "shop", "products"],
							"query": [
								{"key": "category", "value": "Camisetas", "description": "Filtrar por categoría"},
								{"key": "size", "value": "M", "description": "Filtrar por talla"},
								{"key": "q", "value": "qatar", "description": "Búsqueda por nombre/descripción"},
								{"key": "lowStock", "value": "false", "description": "true = solo stock ≤ 5"}
							]
						},
						"description": "Lista productos del catálogo con filtros opcionales."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Checkout (crear pedido)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"name\": \"Juan Pérez\",\n    \"email\": \"juan@email.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"3128502119\",\n    \"address\": \"Cra 12 #34-56\"\n  },\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"productId\": 1,\n      \"quantity\": 2,\n      \"size\": \"M\",\n      \"color\": \"Negro\",\n      \"unitPrice\": 35000\n    }\n  ],\n  \"promoCode\": \"CROVN-123456\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/shop/checkout",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "shop", "checkout"]
						},
						"description": "Crea un pedido:\n- Crea/actualiza el cliente\n- Crea la orden con items\n- Descuenta stock de variantes\n- Aplica código promocional (si es válido)\n- Envía email de confirmación al cliente\n\n**Promo code** es opcional. Si el producto tiene oferta activa, el `unitPrice` ya debe incluir el descuento."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Consultar pedido (email + número)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/shop/orders/lookup?email=juan@email.com&orderId=1",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "shop", "orders", "lookup"],
							"query": [
								{"key": "email", "value": "juan@email.com", "description": "Email de compra"},
								{"key": "orderId", "value": "1", "description": "Número de pedido (acepta #1 o 1)"}
							]
						},
						"description": "Consulta pública de pedido por email + número. Retorna el pedido completo con estado, items y totales."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Historial de pedidos por email",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/shop/orders/by-email?email=juan@email.com",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "shop", "orders", "by-email"],
							"query": [{"key": "email", "value": "juan@email.com"}]
						},
						"description": "Retorna el cliente con todos sus pedidos (unificados por email), incluye badge VIP, conteo de pedidos y total gastado."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "📦 Productos (admin)",
			"description": "CRUD de inventario con variantes (tallas × colores). **Requiere auth.** Las imágenes se envían como `form-data`.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Listar productos",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products?category=Camisetas&q=&lowStock=true",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "products"],
							"query": [
								{"key": "category", "value": "Camisetas"},
								{"key": "q", "value": "", "description": "Búsqueda por nombre/descripción/SKU"},
								{"key": "lowStock", "value": "true", "description": "true = stock ≤ 5"}
							]
						},
						"description": "Lista productos del inventario con filtros. Incluye imágenes y variantes."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Meta (categorías, tallas, colores)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/meta",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "products", "meta"]
						},
						"description": "Retorna categorías, tallas disponibles, colores y URL base de uploads."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Detalle de producto",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/1",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "products", "1"]
						},
						"description": "Retorna un producto con sus imágenes y variantes."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Crear producto (form-data)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{"key": "name", "value": "Crovn Tee Black", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "description", "value": "Camiseta negra 260gr", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "category", "value": "Camisetas", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "size", "value": "M", "type": "text", "description": "Talla principal (XS/S/M/L/XL/XXL)"},
								{"key": "price", "value": "35000", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "stock", "value": "10", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "sku", "value": "CRV-TEE-BLK", "type": "text", "description": "Opcional, se genera automático"},
								{"key": "supplierId", "value": "1", "type": "text", "description": "Opcional, ID del proveedor"},
								{"key": "costPrice", "value": "20000", "type": "text", "description": "Opcional, val proveedor"},
								{"key": "profitPct", "value": "50", "type": "text", "description": "Opcional, % ganancia"},
								{"key": "sizes", "value": "[\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]", "type": "text", "description": "JSON array de tallas seleccionadas"},
								{"key": "colors", "value": "[\"Negro\"]", "type": "text", "description": "JSON array de colores seleccionados"},
								{"key": "image", "value": "", "type": "file", "description": "Imagen principal (opcional)"},
								{"key": "images", "value": "", "type": "file", "description": "Imágenes extra (opcional, múltiples)"}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "products"]
						},
						"description": "Crea un producto con variantes. Cada combinación talla × color genera una variante con su propio stock y SKU.\n\n**Campos form-data:**\n- `name`, `category`, `size`, `price`, `stock` (obligatorios)\n- `sizes` y `colors` como JSON array (checkbox múltiple)\n- `image` (imagen principal), `images` (extra, múltiples)\n- `supplierId`, `costPrice`, `profitPct` (opcional, para costos)"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Actualizar producto (form-data)",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{"key": "name", "value": "Crovn Tee Black", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "description", "value": "Camiseta negra 260gr", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "category", "value": "Camisetas", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "size", "value": "M", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "price", "value": "35000", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "stock", "value": "10", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "supplierId", "value": "", "type": "text", "description": "Vacío = quitar proveedor (null)"},
								{"key": "costPrice", "value": "20000", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "profitPct", "value": "50", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "sizes", "value": "[\"M\",\"L\"]", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "colors", "value": "[\"Negro\"]", "type": "text"},
								{"key": "image", "value": "", "type": "file"},
								{"key": "images", "value": "", "type": "file"}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/1",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "products", "1"]
						},
						"description": "Actualiza producto. **Importante:** envía `supplierId` siempre (vacío = null para desasociar proveedor). Las variantes nuevas se crean automáticamente."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Eliminar producto",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/1",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "products", "1"]
						},
						"description": "Elimina un producto y sus variantes/imágenes."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Ajustar stock",
					"request": {
						"method": "PATCH",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"add\",\n  \"amount\": 10\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/stock",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "products", "1", "stock"]
						},
						"description": "Ajusta stock del producto:\n- `type`: `add` (sumar), `subtract` (restar), `set` (fijar)\n- `amount`: cantidad"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Eliminar imagen extra",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/images/2",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "products", "1", "images", "2"]
						},
						"description": "Elimina una imagen extra del producto (por ID de imagen)."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "👥 Clientes (admin)",
			"description": "CRUD de clientes. **Requiere auth.**",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Listar clientes",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/customers?q=juan",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "customers"],
							"query": [{"key": "q", "value": "juan", "description": "Búsqueda por nombre/email"}]
						},
						"description": "Lista clientes con conteo de pedidos y total gastado. Incluye badge VIP."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Detalle de cliente",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/customers/1",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "customers", "1"]
						},
						"description": "Retorna cliente con sus pedidos."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Crear cliente",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"María García\",\n  \"email\": \"maria@email.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"3128502119\",\n  \"address\": \"Calle 10 #20-30\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/customers",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "customers"]
						},
						"description": "Crea un cliente manualmente."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Actualizar cliente",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"María García\",\n  \"email\": \"maria@email.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"3128502119\",\n  \"address\": \"Calle 10 #20-30\",\n  \"isVIP\": true\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/customers/1",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "customers", "1"]
						},
						"description": "Actualiza cliente. `isVIP` es solo badge (no da descuento automático)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Eliminar cliente",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/customers/1",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "customers", "1"]
						},
						"description": "Elimina cliente (solo si no tiene pedidos)."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "📦 Pedidos (admin)",
			"description": "Gestión de pedidos. **Requiere auth.** Los cambios de estado envían email al cliente.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Listar pedidos",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders?status=Pendiente",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "orders"],
							"query": [{"key": "status", "value": "Pendiente", "description": "Filtrar por estado"}]
						},
						"description": "Lista pedidos con filtro por estado (Pendiente/Procesado/Enviado/Entregado)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Detalle de pedido",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "orders", "1"]
						},
						"description": "Retorna pedido con cliente e items."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Crear pedido (admin)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"customerId\": 1,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\"productId\": 1, \"quantity\": 1, \"price\": 35000}\n  ],\n  \"notifyWhatsApp\": true\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "orders"]
						},
						"description": "Crea un pedido desde el admin. `notifyWhatsApp: true` envía mensaje al negocio."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Cambiar estado (envía email)",
					"request": {
						"method": "PATCH",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"Enviado\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/status",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "orders", "1", "status"]
						},
						"description": "Cambia el estado del pedido y envía email al cliente.\n\n**Estados:** Pendiente → Procesado → Enviado → Entregado (o Anulado)\n\n**Nota:** No se puede anular un pedido Enviado/Entregado."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Eliminar pedido",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "orders", "1"]
						},
						"description": "Elimina pedido (solo Pendiente/Procesado; rechaza Enviado/Entregado)."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "🎟️ Códigos promocionales (admin)",
			"description": "CRUD de códigos de descuento. **Requiere auth.** El endpoint de validación es público.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Listar códigos",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/promo-codes",
